{"data": [{"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-10-31T19:54:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116619844241981652"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Beijing’s evolving industrial playbook is taking shape in Morocco.", "display_url": "foreignpolicy.com/2026/10/27/chi…", "end": 146, "expanded_url": "https://foreignpolicy.com/2026/10/27/china-europe-morocco-electric-vehicle-manufacturing-industrial-policy/", "images": [{"height": 1000, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115171728624078848/g0hs2smF?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1500}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115171728624078848/g0hs2smF?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 123, "status": 200, "title": "China Is Building Its Way Around Europe’s EV Tariffs", "unwound_url": "https://foreignpolicy.com/2026/10/27/china-europe-morocco-electric-vehicle-manufacturing-industrial-policy/", "url": "https://t.co/bcxmssTG6I"}]}, "id": "2116619844241981652", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 796, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\"China Is Building Its Way Around Europe’s EV Tariffs...Beijing’s evolving industrial playbook is taking shape in Morocco\"\nhttps://t.co/bcxmssTG6I", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2116619844241981652"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-10-31T19:42:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116616830911496603"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 163, "start": 157, "tag": "China"}], "urls": [{"description": "KoBold Metals has asked the US state department for help as it waits on UN Security Council clearance to run aerial surveys", "display_url": "ft.com/content/d35c06…", "end": 261, "expanded_url": "https://www.ft.com/content/d35c065f-0aef-44fa-a0d8-be1e0e5281c8", "images": [{"height": 394, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116114787054522368/wvpG2O1T?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 700}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116114787054522368/wvpG2O1T?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 238, "status": 200, "title": "Gates-backed miner says China is frustrating DR Congo exploration efforts", "unwound_url": "https://www.ft.com/content/d35c065f-0aef-44fa-a0d8-be1e0e5281c8", "url": "https://t.co/CSuBS4I53R"}]}, "id": "2116616830911496603", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 836, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\"A mining company backed by Bill Gates has asked the US govt for help w/its $50M lithium exploration programme in the Democratic Republic of Congo, alleging #China had resorted to a UN arms embargo to block its use of mapping technology\"\nhttps://t.co/CSuBS4I53R", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2116616830911496603"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-10-31T19:40:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116616401129701716"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "China said Swiss companies are planning to increase investment in the country in sectors including pharmaceuticals and machinery manufacturing.", "display_url": "bloomberg.com/news/articles/…", "end": 88, "expanded_url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-31/swiss-firms-plan-investment-boost-in-china-drug-finance-sectors", "images": [{"height": 799, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116430560767688704/nom7n3pN?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116430560767688704/nom7n3pN?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 65, "status": 200, "title": "Swiss Firms Plan Investment Boost in China Drug, Finance Sectors", "unwound_url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-31/swiss-firms-plan-investment-boost-in-china-drug-finance-sectors", "url": "https://t.co/jg2f6uN19B"}]}, "id": "2116616401129701716", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 798, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Swiss Firms Plan Investment Boost in China Drug, Finance Sectors\nhttps://t.co/jg2f6uN19B", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2116616401129701716"}, {"author_id": "3512101", "created_at": "2026-10-31T18:41:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116601398276088151"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/theathleticfc/…", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/theathleticfc/status/2116562531187593232", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/jf6rkzpBQL"}]}, "id": "2116601398276088151", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2473, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116562531187593232", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "““This situation with China highlights the dangers of today’s world, where often the best thing to do is to keep your mouth shut because there’s a risk in so many of the things you say and comment on, but I’ve seen him act very responsibly and with a very big, classy club,” https://t.co/jf6rkzpBQL", "url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2116601398276088151"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-10-31T17:59:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116590787861574041"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/discussingfilm…", "end": 67, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/discussingfilm/status/2116214510528983327", "start": 44, "url": "https://t.co/XOebkfIRdT"}]}, "id": "2116590787861574041", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1479, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116214510528983327", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This sounds much better than the 2013 movie https://t.co/XOebkfIRdT", "url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2116590787861574041"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-31T17:54:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116589576269746425"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 36, "start": 24, "tag": "SaveTheBars"}], "mentions": [{"end": 79, "id": "239026022", "start": 73, "username": "SamRo"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/UFb9RL0tzT", "end": 111, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2116589576269746425/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116589565288816640", "start": 88, "url": "https://t.co/UFb9RL0tzT"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/UFb9RL0tzT", "end": 111, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2116589576269746425/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116589565297274880", "start": 88, "url": "https://t.co/UFb9RL0tzT"}]}, "id": "2116589576269746425", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 20448, "like_count": 144, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "It’s a beautiful day to #SaveTheBars at Tompkins Square. Even our friend @samro is here https://t.co/UFb9RL0tzT", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2116589576269746425"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-31T16:18:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116565498532098436"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/regimeideologu…", "end": 169, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/regimeideologue/status/2116564791670296706", "start": 146, "url": "https://t.co/aEjSYehCFW"}]}, "id": "2116565498532098436", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 28957, "like_count": 453, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 26, "retweet_count": 15}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116564791670296706", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "He’s actually not. Like it’s 2026 and your economy is built around hacking crypto and using your citizens as mercenaries? It’s kinda cringe, imo. https://t.co/aEjSYehCFW", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2116565498532098436"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-31T16:11:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116563600298873317"], "id": "2116563600298873317", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 25534, "like_count": 349, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 33, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "It’s been a fun experiment. But this diet of just eating meat and kimchi may be running its course for me. I think as of today, I’m swapping in sauerkraut for a little while.", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2116563600298873317"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-31T15:24:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116551796340490366"], "id": "2116551796340490366", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 13179, "like_count": 107, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "In many respects, when I look at the world these days, I divide it between 'China' and 'Everywhere else'.\n\nThe exception is anything having to do with social media and phones, which seem to have the same effects on society anywhere in the world.", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2116551796340490366"}, {"author_id": "3512101", "created_at": "2026-10-31T15:21:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116551152699404792"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/realsert8964/s…", "end": 82, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/realsert8964/status/2116550475860558178", "start": 59, "url": "https://t.co/COTunXYX05"}]}, "id": "2116551152699404792", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 51, "impression_count": 14537, "like_count": 133, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 20}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116550475860558178", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Next installment of this genius mocking of the mbappe mess https://t.co/COTunXYX05", "url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2116551152699404792"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-10-31T15:12:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116548930653835661"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/mtkonczal/stat…", "end": 269, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/mtkonczal/status/2116521192631017555", "start": 246, "url": "https://t.co/jlx81ToImK"}]}, "id": "2116548930653835661", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1858, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116521192631017555", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I enjoyed reading Mike’s piece.\n\nImho regardless of your political orientation, the next few years (at least) of policymaking will involve making unpleasant tradeoffs and tightening belts\n\nThe “slack resources” context of the late 2010s is gone. https://t.co/jlx81ToImK", "url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2116548930653835661"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-10-31T14:34:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116539207833317603"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 108, "start": 94, "tag": "Manufacturing"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/Sino_Market/st…", "end": 286, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/Sino_Market/status/2116348489047380122", "start": 263, "url": "https://t.co/CFspT1ghkH"}]}, "id": "2116539207833317603", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1489, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116348489047380122", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "What's amusing here is not the directional 🇨🇳 PMI result (weakness), which we also saw in our #Manufacturing data for October.\n\nIt's that expectations for the month were...a perfect 50.0.\n\nHow do more folks not break out in laughter when dealing w/this nonsense? https://t.co/CFspT1ghkH", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2116539207833317603"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-31T14:32:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116538931663540255"], "id": "2116538931663540255", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 98, "impression_count": 89662, "like_count": 1081, "quote_count": 12, "reply_count": 110, "retweet_count": 36}, "text": "It’s funny, I think I’m pretty AI-pilled. And I’m sure a lot of people who follow me think I’m AI-pilled to an annoying degree.\n\nBut I can easily go days without really using it. And there is no job I encounter professionally where I think AI is anywhere close to human level.", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2116538931663540255"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-31T14:05:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116532045530984733"], "id": "2116532045530984733", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 15298, "like_count": 122, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 13, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Just a reminder that at 1:30 today, a bunch of regulars are going to be at the Tompkins Square exercise bars (northeast corner). Please come out and say hi and do a few chin-ups with us. They’re good for you.", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2116532045530984733"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-10-31T13:41:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116525849251914149"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 26, "id": "156016878", "start": 15, "username": "Neil_Irwin"}, {"end": 36, "id": "800707492346925056", "start": 30, "username": "axios"}], "urls": [{"description": "More of employers' overall spending on worker compensation is going to health benefits, leaving less for wages and salaries.", "display_url": "axios.com/2026/10/30/hea…", "end": 158, "expanded_url": "https://www.axios.com/2026/10/30/health-care-wages-employment-cost-index", "images": [{"height": 768, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116199860231651328/FC0i6X-U?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1366}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116199860231651328/FC0i6X-U?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 135, "status": 200, "title": "Health care is eating Americans' paychecks", "unwound_url": "https://www.axios.com/2026/10/30/health-care-wages-employment-cost-index", "url": "https://t.co/YoQAI2OBpu"}]}, "id": "2116525849251914149", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 3584, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Am grateful to @Neil_Irwin at @axios for chatting with me about how surging health insurance costs are squeezing workers' pay raises.\n\nhttps://t.co/YoQAI2OBpu", "url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2116525849251914149"}, {"author_id": "3512101", "created_at": "2026-10-31T13:02:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116516180097696203"], "id": "2116516180097696203", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 3160, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "\"\"General Secretary Xi Jinping addressed the doubts some people have: “Does comprehensively and strictly governing the Party hinder economic and social development, or does it safeguard and promote it?”", "url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2116516180097696203"}, {"author_id": "917683048782503937", "created_at": "2026-10-31T07:11:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116427817609032055"], "id": "2116427817609032055", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 8519, "like_count": 46, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 8}, "text": "Caixin: \"China’s banks are being encouraged to steer more credit toward technology, green industries and small businesses. But as overall demand for loans weakens, the policy push is creating increasing competition to lend to companies that may need their money least, while some", "url": "https://x.com/michaelxpettis/status/2116427817609032055"}, {"author_id": "917683048782503937", "created_at": "2026-10-31T06:41:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116420177562620406"], "id": "2116420177562620406", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 10534, "like_count": 30, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 8}, "text": "Xinhua: \"China's manufacturing activity moderated in October, with the PMI falling to 49.3, while high-tech and equipment manufacturing sectors maintained expansion. Large manufacturers continued to report expansion, with their PMI standing at 50.2, despite a slight decline of", "url": "https://x.com/michaelxpettis/status/2116420177562620406"}, {"author_id": "917683048782503937", "created_at": "2026-10-31T06:36:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116419107318866362"], "id": "2116419107318866362", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 27, "impression_count": 21070, "like_count": 187, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 24}, "text": "In a story about rising Chinese consumption Xinhua notes that in the first three quarters of 2026, \"domestic consumption contributed nearly half of economic growth, driving GDP growth up by 2.1 percentage points\".\n\nWhat it doesn't say is that excluding twice during the COVID", "url": "https://x.com/michaelxpettis/status/2116419107318866362"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-10-31T02:07:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116351224585097400"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/inlandcaguy/st…", "end": 161, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/inlandcaguy/status/2116321802662338580", "start": 138, "url": "https://t.co/KatkLQHdxO"}]}, "id": "2116351224585097400", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2868, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116321802662338580", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I agree that Patrick Stewart was perfect for “The Inner Light”…\n\nOTOH I can’t imagine the TNG ensemble pulling off “Far Beyond the Stars” https://t.co/KatkLQHdxO", "url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2116351224585097400"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-10-31T00:14:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116322811082072295"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/EconBerger/sta…", "end": 59, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/EconBerger/status/2116315630559490340", "start": 36, "url": "https://t.co/F1ErUHcWxA"}]}, "id": "2116322811082072295", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "i